classes\ that\ reside\ in\ any\ package\ ['..domain..',\ '..entity..']\ and\ are\ annotated\ with\ @Entity\ and\ not\ has\ a\ composite\ primary\ key\ (@EmbeddedId)\ should\ be\ assignable\ to\ com.outreach.platform.common.entity.BaseEntity,\ because\ All\ JPA\ entities\ must\ extend\ BaseEntity\ or\ TenantAwareBaseEntity\ to\ ensure\ consistent\ audit\ fields\ and\ tenant\ isolation=30eb2447-21c7-4862-b9f4-8faa60752470
